    "aristotle_usage": "The means by which persuasion is effected; divided into technical (entechnoi: ethos, pathos, logos) and non-technical (atechnoi: laws, witnesses, contracts, tortures, oaths). Kennedy: 'means of persuasion'; Roberts: 'modes of persuasion'.",
