    "conventional_translations": ["setting before the eyes", "making visible", "bringing before the eyes"],
    "aristotle_usage": "Metaphor that represents things in a state of activity (energeia), producing visualization in the audience. The culmination of the metaphor theory. Homer paradigmatic: giving metaphorical life to lifeless things.",
