    "greek_unicode": "ἐνέργεια",
    "forms_encountered": ["ἐνέργεια", "ἐνεργείᾳ"],
    "conventional_translations": ["actuality", "activity", "vividness"],
    "aristotle_usage": "In Rhetoric III.11: the representation of things as active or alive, the mechanism by which metaphor produces visualization. Homer paradigmatic. Distinct from but related to the metaphysical sense (Met. Theta: being-at-work).",
