    "conventional_translations": ["art", "craft", "skill"],
    "aristotle_usage": "Rhetoric is a techne: a systematic, teachable faculty. Yet metaphor (its supreme tool) cannot be taught. Art must conceal itself. Tension between systematic teachability and natural genius.",
